/E (This report combines Allium onchain data and FXC Intelligence market sizing data to provide robust directional estimates for the size of the stablecoin and non-stablecoin retail cross-border payments market, sometimes referred to as the non-wholesale market. This covers payments involving either businesses or consumers made between two countries, but excludes wholesale payments between financial institutions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
