/P 67 0 R
/E (Focusing on the most recent full year, 2025, with additional data for 2024 to provide context and growth rates, the collaboration has seen both companies work closely together to align their disparate datasets and provide a robust view of the current state of stablecoin adoption in cross-border payments. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
