/E (If current rates hold, C2C and B2C look set to pass the 1% penetration mark in 2026, the point at which stablecoins move from a rounding error to a measurable share of those segments. The more telling shift, though, is directional: cross-border payments are beginning to sort by use case and by market, and stablecoins are establishing themselves first where the traditional system serves users least well.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
